  "behavior": "It roams the Skunk Pond and can become aggressive toward any target that gets too close. Once a chase begins, it uses its speed and enormous size to quickly catch its target.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is extremely dangerous and cannot be killed. Its attacks are unblockable and deal heavy damage, so being detected in open water can put you in danger very quickly.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "As one of the pond's major predators, it may attack smaller creatures encountered along its route. It does not appear to have a documented exclusive interaction like Sunny's preference for tadpoles.",
